<title>THAILAND: Ch Karnchang pays 2 baht dividend for 1996.</title>
<headline>Ch Karnchang pays 2 baht dividend for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			    Twelve months</p>
<p>				    1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Dividend (baht)	   2.00	 vs	 2.50</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend		 May 8, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date		May 27, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Ch Karnchang Plc, a construction contractor.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
